{"last_link_id": 34, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [8], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "size": [264.28875732421875, 114.238037109375], "pos": [-97.57025909423828, 305.0830993652344], "widgets_values": ["Please generate a mobile application interface with a white theme, creating a clean, modern, and vibrant look.\nTop Navigation Bar\nApp Logo: At the top left, a centered app logo. The logo is the text \"EroChat\" in a deep pink font with a subtle shadow effect.\nCurrency Display: On the top right, display two types of in-game currency. On the left is a lightning bolt icon next to the number \"8,\" and on the right is a diamond icon next to the number \"125.\"\nTitle: Below the logo, there is a dark gray or black title \"每日任务\" (Daily Tasks), with a short horizontal line on each side as a decoration.\nMain Content Area (Layered Design)\nBackground Image: In the middle of the screen is a large, rounded rectangular banner. Its background is a futuristic night club interior with a blue-purple color palette and bright neon lights. Details should include a bar, tables, and glowing geometric decorations to create a cool, high-tech atmosphere.\nCountdown Overlay: Overlapping the top of this night club background is a white, rounded rectangle that intersects with the top of the background image. The center of this white rectangle displays the dark gray or black text: \"重设剩余时间: 12时31分\" (Reset remaining time: 12 hours 31 minutes).\nTask Progress: In the bottom-left corner of the night club background image, display \"已完成的任务：0/9\" (Completed tasks: 0/9) in a light gray font.\nTreasure Chest Graphic: In the top-right corner of the night club background image, place a glowing, stylized treasure chest graphic with three gold coins and a shield above it.\nTask List\nTask Cards: Below the night club background, vertically arrange three separate white, rounded rectangular cards. The text on these cards should be in a dark gray or black font to ensure legibility against the white background.\nCard 1 (Wheel): On the left is a colorful Wheel of Fortune icon. The text is \"游玩命运轮盘 2次\" (Play the Wheel of Fortune 2 times), with a progress bar below and the text \"已完成\" (Completed) next to it. On the far right is a blue \"领取\" (Claim) button.\nCard 2 (Chat): On the left is a chat bubble icon with three dots. The text is \"选择高级答案 0/1\" (Select advanced answer 0/1). On the far right is a gray \"前往\" (Go) button.\nCard 3 (Gem): On the left is a large, blue diamond or gem icon. The text is \"领取免费宝石 3次 0/3\" (Claim free gems 3 times 0/3). On the far right is a gray \"前往\" (Go) button.\nBottom Navigation Bar\nNavigation Bar: At the very bottom, there is a simple, horizontal navigation bar. This bar should be white or a very light gray.\nIcons: From left to right, there are four icons. The first is a person icon (likely for profile), the second is a shopping cart icon with a pink notification dot, the third is two stylized, overlapping cards (one pink, one red), and the fourth is a chat bubble icon. These icons should have good contrast against the white navigation bar."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 1, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 28, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.52", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [10], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["色调艳丽，过曝，静态，细节模糊不清，风格，作品，整体发灰，最差质量，低质量，JPEG压缩残留，丑陋的，残缺的，多余的手指，画得不好的手部，画得不好的脸部，畸形的，毁容的，形态畸形的肢体，手指融合，杂乱的背景，三条腿，"], "inputs